# Read by MSBuild for every build in this repo (dotnet build, dotnet run, dotnet test).
# One build node: Core and Sdk are built under more than one set of global properties (the Host's own references,
# and again by its bundled-plugin step), and two nodes compiling the same project at once overwrite each other's
# obj files ("Could not copy MapleLite.Core.dll because it was not found"). One node builds them one after another.
-maxCpuCount:1
-nodeReuse:false
